    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">請問 Rattle 無法讀取 csv 檔案，該如何處理呢？請協助、謝謝<div>訊息如下:<br><div>Error in loadNamespace(name)  : there is no package called ‘stringr’<br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "_nhpVOQiCAAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2017-08-26T12:08:22Z",
   "subject": "Re: Rattle無法讀取檔案",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jen,<div><br></div><div>1. 請先安裝 stringr 套件, 即在R console 視窗中輸入:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stringr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>2. 近日 R-3.4.1 + Windows 10 安裝 rattle 有以下錯誤或畫面沒反應:</div><div><font color=\"#ff9900\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\">rattle Error in method(obj, ...) : Invalid root element: &#39;requires&#39;</font></div><div><br></div><div>改用以下方式應可解決:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>install.packages(&quot;rattle&quot;, repos=&quot;<a href=\"http://rattle.togaware.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rattle.togaware.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237594925000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1f2LIOEk6SRWZWLDLS6583\">http://rattle.togaware.com</a>&quot;)</div></div></code></div><div><br></div><br><div>D.Jen於 2017年8月26日星期六 UTC+8下午4時59分36秒寫道：</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">請問 Rattle 無法讀取 csv 檔案，該如何處理呢？請協助、謝謝<div>訊息如下:<br><div>Error in loadNamespace(name)  : there is no package called ‘stringr’<br></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
